{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132480/extras/6ff2a2cf692bfe781911515fa637469c.avif?t=1771400707\" width=780 height=246 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132480/extras/a6cb56f0c001e484e7cce334c5598b3b.webp?t=1771400707\" width=780 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Marcus Holmes, a young private detective and the nephew of the legendary sleuth Arthur Holmes, known in elite circles as \u201cThe Detective of Desire\u201d \u2014 a man who unraveled the intimate secrets of the rich and powerful: affairs, disappearances, scandals, and betrayals.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132480/extras/def17db79fbeb77586c9fa4217f2408a.avif?t=1771400707\" width=780 height=319 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now Arthur is dead.\u2028 The official cause \u2014 a heart attack.\u2028 But his will says:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cAll my possessions, including my archives, are to be inherited by my nephew.\u2028 Along with them \u2014 my final secret.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You move into his penthouse \u2014 a place still scented with expensive perfume, coffee, and unspoken words. Among the old papers, you find an encrypted dossier marked \u201cL.U.S.T.\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From that moment, your life becomes a chain of mysterious encounters, letters, and confessions from Arthur\u2019s former clients \u2014 beautiful, dangerous women who may be connected to his death.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132480/extras/b02072cfc12b298e74af20df79324960.webp?t=1771400707\" width=780 height=44 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No scripts \u2014 create your own scenarios: you decide who, how, and where you fuck. Experiment with sex, influence the heroines and the environment, and create scenes ranging from romantic to hardcore. The world reacts dynamically \u2014 public debauchery changes the city, unlocking new events, clubs, and risks like jail.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132480/extras/18008940d0f07a38b69b476b5c43e124.poster.avif?t=1771400707\" width=776 height=290 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132480/extras/18008940d0f07a38b69b476b5c43e124.webm?t=1771400707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1. Liberating the Heroines</strong>\u2028</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seduce or dominate the girls, raising their &quot;Corruption Level&quot;\u2028</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new positions, sex acts, and scenes \u2014 from private encounters to public orgies.\u2028</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you experiment, the bolder they become: invite other characters to join in for a gangbang!\u2028</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>2. Public Sex &amp; Consequences</strong>\u2028</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Have sex anywhere \u2014 in the park, the bar, or on the street.\u2028</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A &quot;Wanted Meter&quot; system: too much public action increases the risk of arrest (and jail has its own unique &quot;entertainments&quot;).</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world reacts: rumors can attract allies, maniacs, or the police.\u2028</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>3. Sandbox: Total Freedom</strong>\u2028</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No scripts \u2014 create your own scenarios. You have the ultimate power to decide who, how, and where you fuck.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132480/extras/f3b77ae4dff28743de09e1849e3da585.webp?t=1771400707\" width=780 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132480/extras/d940c4d5f1759b46048df8d89a8b87d8.poster.avif?t=1771400707\" width=776 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132480/extras/d940c4d5f1759b46048df8d89a8b87d8.webm?t=1771400707\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Guilty Pleasures</strong>\u00a0combines elements of detective investigation, a sandbox, and an interactive thriller.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Investigation</strong>:\u00a0Freely explore the house and city streets, search for clues, analyze the environment, and examine personal items and documents.\u2028</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mini-games</strong>:\u00a0Eavesdrop on conversations, crack passwords, hack devices, conduct surveillance, and interrogate characters by choosing your pressure tactics.\u2028</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Social System</strong>:\u00a0Exchange texts and calls with characters; manipulate them, gain their trust or incite fear, and extract information through flirting or threats.\u2028</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Moral Choices</strong>:\u00a0Decide what matters most to you \u2014 the truth, passion, or personal gain.\u2028</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings</strong>:\u00a0The fate of Marcus and the resolution of Arthur's mystery depend on who you trust and what lines you are willing to cross.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132480/extras/3c5ce5c92c51038f4913b7879be2ee59.avif?t=1771400707\" width=780 height=510 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4132480?t=1771400707","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132480/8ff72b41dc49501f8eb4b0e49151d1b1ebc80b79/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771400707","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132480/9b88ca2b2d4bb5d0555a79d62eefb7d8ef4c98c8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771400707","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132480/9b88ca2b2d4bb5d0555a79d62eefb7d8ef4c98c8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771400707","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,2,3,4,5],"notes":"All characters in the game are older than 21. The game contains adult content including nudity and NSFW content. The game contains some profanity. Some characters using cigaretes and alcohol. \r\n\r\nThe game features nude girl and animated H-scenes. The game contains adult material and scenes of a sexual nature. All sex in the game is consensual."},"detailed_description":"<h1>\ud83d\udc96 RELEASE VERY SOON \ud83d\udc96</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"h